(See above cisco-ios/cisco-cat section for descriptions. These are the SSH
counterparts of cisco-ios and cisco-asa; the login is done over SSH with
user/pass, and the shell is then driven the same way as the telnet models.)

Option                  Description
----------------------  --------------------------------------------------------
