                        written against went straight from login to the "#"
                        (privileged) prompt with no separate "enable" step - the
                        account used already had privilege 15. This option only
                        matters for an account/firmware that does land on a ">"
                        prompt needing "enable"; it's read the same way
                        CiscoIOS.pm handles Cisco's own enable password.
repository              Mandatory.
keep                    Mandatory.
