                        "show running-config" command. The pager is disabled
                        with "no page" beforehand.
prompt_settle_ms        Optional. Milliseconds to wait for output to go idle
                        before matching the command prompt (default 150; 0
                        disables). The prompt token allows spaces and non-ASCII
                        (AOS-CX hostnames can contain both); this settle keeps a
                        banner line that ends in "#" from being mistaken for the
                        prompt. Raise it on a slow/laggy link.
debug                   Optional. Boolean. If specified as debug=on (default
                        off), records to <repository>/<dev_id>.debug first the
                        ssh client's verbose account of the SSH authentication
                        and then the raw switch session - same layout as
                        planet-ssh.

